<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
